WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 line:0
Dou Dizhu: 17 cards each plus 3 bottom cards.
The landlord faces two farmers; first out wins.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:18.000 line:0
North presses 1, East bids 2, South passes:
the highest bidder, East, is landlord.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.500 line:0
The bottom cards are shown and join East’s hand;
East leads.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.999 line:0
Fast-forward: the two farmers are allies;
South goes out first and the farmers win.

00:00:28.999 --> 00:00:34.999 line:0
Fast-forward: East opens the next auction;
North bids 2 and becomes landlord.

00:00:34.999 --> 00:00:45.999 line:0
North selects six consecutive cards;
the button shows a straight. Press Play.

00:00:45.999 --> 00:00:54.999 line:0
Fast-forward: follow with the same type, higher;
when both others pass, the last player leads.

00:00:54.999 --> 00:01:05.999 line:0
Each deal re-auctions the landlord;
scores add up over six deals.

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:15.000 line:0
North wins with 7 points in total;
South has −2 and East has −5.
